# ── Dua corpus + hub pages: DELIBERATELY UNPUBLISHED (ADR-060 licence hold) ──
# Untracked 2026-07-31 so GitHub Pages stops serving them while the upstream
# English licensing question is open. These are ignored, not deleted — every
# file is still on disk, and scripts/build-dua-landing-pages.mjs regenerates
# the 30 hubs on every run. Without these entries the next `git add -A`
# silently re-publishes all 32 files.
#
# TO RESTORE once the licence question is resolved: delete this block, then
# `git add` the paths. Do NOT use `git add -f` to commit one file past the
# ignore — that reopens the exposure without removing the guard.
#
# search-corpus.json is the CORPUS OF RECORD and its documented generator is
# disarmed (ADR-058). A copy lives outside the repo; see its README.
duas/occasion/*.html
duas/source/*.html
src/data/dua/search-corpus.json
src/data/dua/library.json
